# About Wyndham Hotels & Resorts
Wyndham Hotels & Resorts is the world's largest hotel franchising company by number of properties, operating under the tagline **"Where There's a Wyndham, There's a Way℠"**. The company offers a broad portfolio of brands spanning economy to distinctive/upscale segments, with a commitment to making hotel travel accessible to everyday travelers worldwide.

> **Brand identity highlights:** *Value*, *accessibility*, *loyalty rewards*, *road-trip friendly*, *direct-booking savings*, *family friendly*, *pet friendly*, *extended-stay options*, *all-inclusive resorts*, *boutique & lifestyle stays*, *business travel*, *casino & entertainment hotels*, *beach & resort destinations*.

