# Wyndham Rewards (Loyalty Program)
Wyndham Rewards is the loyalty program for Wyndham Hotels & Resorts, consistently rated among the top hotel rewards programs.

* **Earning:** Up to 10 points per dollar or 1,000 points (whichever is greater) for every qualified stay
* **Redemption:** Free nights starting at 7,500 points; discounted nights starting at 750 points + cash
* **More Than Hotels:** Points can also be earned and redeemed for experiences, activities, dining, and gift cards
* **Member Perk:** Members always get the lowest available price when booking direct on the site or app; free WiFi included
* **Wyndham Rewards Insider:** A paid subscription tier ($95/year) with upgraded VIP discounts, faster earning, and exclusive offers

## Member Levels
* **Blue** – Entry level (automatic upon joining)
* **Gold** – Mid-tier with enhanced benefits
* **Platinum** – Higher tier with premium perks
* **Diamond** – Top-tier with maximum benefits

> **Reference:** https://www.wyndhamhotels.com/wyndham-rewards/member-levels

